# Initial Setup's HW ID page, ported from GCSViews/ConfigurationView/ConfigHWIDs.cs (PLAN.md §13.6
# row 70).
#
# The claim: Activate lists every parameter whose name has _ID or _DEVID but neither _IDX nor
# FRSKY, ordered by name, each device id taken apart as DeviceInfo takes it - ParamName, DevID,
# BusType, Bus, Address, DevType (ConfigHWIDs.cs:16-31, DeviceInfo.cs, ExtLibs/Utilities/
# Device.cs) - in a read-only grid of the Designer's six columns (ConfigHWIDs.Designer.cs:66-114).
# The page is listed under Mandatory Hardware once every parameter is in (InitialSetup.cs:241).
#
# SITL's copter lists thirty such names, MOT_IDLE_SEC and SIM_MAG_SAVE_IDS among them (the test is
# on the name alone, as in Mission Planner); its INS_ACC_ID is the SITL IMU on bus 0 at address 2,
# its COMPASS_DEV_ID a DroneCAN node. Nothing is written.
#
# Needs SITL copter on tcp:127.0.0.1:5760 started from tools/sitl/params/copter.parm. Run as
#
#   tools/gui-test.sh tests/gui/config-hwids.gui -- tcp:127.0.0.1:5760

screen params
window 1600x1200
budget 5
# A config.xml of its own, so the "Show me again?" boxes this script clicks are not already
# suppressed by the settings of the machine running it.
env MP_CONFIG_XML $WORK/config.xml
# RawParamWarning, on the Full Parameter List's Activate (ConfigRawParams.cs:92): "Show me
# again?" unticked, so no later visit asks, and OK.
# The vehicle first: a click before its first heartbeat is a click the screen may forget
# (vehicle.connected only says the link is open).
expect vehicle.count > 0
click raw-param-warning-again
click raw-param-warning-ok

click param-download
expect params.held > 1000

click tab-setup
expect config.hwids.active false
click setup-page-ConfigMandatory
click setup-page-ConfigHWIDs
expect setup.page ConfigHWIDs
expect config.hwids.active true
expect config.hwids.columns ParamName,DevID,BusType,Bus,Address,DevType
expect config.hwids.rows 30
expect config.hwids.order ~ BARO1_DEVID,BARO2_DEVID,BARO3_DEVID
expect config.hwids.order ~ INS_ACC_ID,INS_ACC2_ID
expect config.hwids.row.INS_ACC_ID 2753028,SITL,0,2,SITL
expect config.hwids.row.BARO1_DEVID 65540,SITL,0,0,BARO_SITL
expect config.hwids.row.COMPASS_DEV_ID 97539,UAVCAN,0,125,SENSOR_ID#1
expect config.hwids.row.MOT_IDLE_SEC 0,UNKNOWN,0,0,0

# Choosing another page hides this one; it is IActivate only.
click setup-page-ConfigOptional
expect config.hwids.active false
